<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah chief again demanded Lebanon release five detained operatives while rejecting any post-UNIFIL force outside U.N. authority, and he reiterated that Iran works for Hezbollah. Israeli warplanes intensified low-altitude flights over southern Lebanon and the Nabatieh region and Israel opposed French troop deployment in south Lebanon, warning it would grant Hezbollah freedom of movement. Israeli airstrikes hit the town of Hadatha and Israeli forces shelled, demolished and swept southern Lebanon, while a Jordanian sailor’s body was recovered near the UAE coast after a tanker attack. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPN1AtRDNCZ1RzMGFIcTdpSXU3U3MyZkFWOWFEdVpJcXBzb2ljM0dOMjNELUpXOEwzMFVoWFNaaXNybFVldTZ1cHkzUWhjZ1VFNXVKOE1tQ01POWpSN1owYVhnNTRQRnRORUdCUTVpTVpEUG9NLU1NVHFNYVhOUFIxdU1vR0tLeWtrQTBCSTY5VWZoV0VaTDR3ZFFidXI1MTBTYmp4R0ZHTnJMeUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5qWmsxd0NfdTVHeEJvZW5WMzdMUjZWVWRscVhEQURCMXd5QnNjcUlpM1c5cnhVM3ZVYVVFcC1xRWdXMTE4WTZzQVVxMXJfelU?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPNzUyTXpyWW5vcmN5MktleWplR2I4NWVYTl9jVjJXQXVSdVNEUkRaeGtad1dfUEROalQ1QzdXOENrNVhER1hSc005a3EyU2VWU2tiT1VwY3NkRmRLMVlhcTVsVFg3ZzVEbFV3NkVQWDZ1dXc5dkJ0ZTd0THRldzZrbzlndDh6UjlHQ0pZMFJQVEs5ZndxUUxVNURCMXhtcWJPNnJ5bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Naharnet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNT1ZXN0c1T3RtOWJFVlRDR1pEVkxtUlk4OUhvVEFUSXllOWI5VUFFb0FlVEtpcHFkYmZkQ3d4ajE5M3kxQnhNT0d1ZG1Can